Run 40 fails at the step limit. The task is "look at cd under the desklamp". At step 3 the model turns on the desklamp, and from step 4 on it examines the dresser and the desklamp, and from step 9 to step 50 it strictly alternates "examine dresser 1" and "examine desklamp 1", getting the same two answers each time. It never looks for the cd. Nothing in the harness reacts: it keeps the history of actions and observations and passes it to the hooks, but no hook looks at it.

Code: the history is filled at src/harness.py:107-108 and passed in ctx (src/harness.py:65); on_before_action and on_post_step return None (src/hooks.py:9-14).

Logs: logs/run_40.jsonl, line 12: "You turn on the desklamp 1."; line 13 {"action": "examine dresser 1"} -> line 15 "On the dresser 1, you see a cellphone 2, a desklamp 1, ..."; line 16 {"action": "examine desklamp 1"} -> line 18 "You turn on the desklamp 1."; the same pair repeats up to line 151-153. End at line 154: "step limit".

